vocab_talk=["Using <em>adaptation</em>, <em>plateau</em> and <em>inconclusive</em>, explain in your own words why research on money and happiness has produced such different headlines.","Which of the ten words are about people, which about measurement and which about the evidence? Sort them and say why."],
